{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act17side_level_act17side_03_end",
  "groupId": "act17side",
  "stageId": "act17side_03",
  "title": "安静的步道",
  "storyCode": "SN-3",
  "avgTag": "行动后",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act17side/level_act17side_03_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "4be45eba465a7bd42d8ca92b4ca9eab5f6ee81c6a292d7c7d7081aa201c19db2",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "圣徒卡门",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_447_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "与报告如出一辙，我很好奇这究竟是一只怎样的生物。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
      "speakerToken": "npc_10002",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（警示性的低鸣）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "圣徒卡门",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_447_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "喔喔......别生气，小家伙，看来你能听懂人话。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂娅",
      "speakerToken": "avg_474_gladiia_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这些恐鱼的身上有别的寄生物......但我从未在陆地上见过它们。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "圣徒卡门",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_447_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "伊比利亚人称之为“溟痕”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "圣徒卡门",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_447_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "大静谧之后，伊比利亚的沿海居民偶尔会看见海洋发光的现象。最早的一次目击报告在十七年前。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "圣徒卡门",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_447_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我们的科研学者认为这是某种浮游生物集中爆发的结果。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "圣徒卡门",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_447_1#10$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那么，机会难得，我想知道阿戈尔人见过这些......令人不安的东西吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂娅",
      "speakerToken": "avg_474_gladiia_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "阿戈尔过去极少见到这样的现象，但是荧光的植物？科学院富丽堂皇的花园里从不缺这类观赏品。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "圣徒卡门",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_447_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "原来阿戈尔人也懂得何为“观赏”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂娅",
      "speakerToken": "avg_474_gladiia_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "“溟痕”——唯独这个命名十分准确，这种现象即是海洋对陆地的触碰。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂娅",
      "speakerToken": "avg_474_gladiia_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "而这些蔓延的“溟痕”，本质上和我们在盐风城见到的恐鱼别无二致。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "圣徒卡门",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_447_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "喔......你是说，这种自然现象本身亦是“恐鱼”的一种生物形式？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂娅",
      "speakerToken": "avg_474_gladiia_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "似乎伊比利亚的生物学家们还不够努力。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "圣徒卡门",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_447_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......情况比预想的复杂，但也不超过最坏的可能。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "圣徒卡门",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_447_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "审判庭所目击、杀死、捕获的恐鱼种类几乎每个月都在变化。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "圣徒卡门",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_447_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "而最快的一次发生在三号海岸线，只经过了四五个日落之后，我们面对的敌人就几乎面目全非。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "海洋正在侵袭陆地，如我所说的那样，以它自己的方式。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "现在，我要去救助罗德岛的干员。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂娅",
      "speakerToken": "avg_474_gladiia_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我同你一起。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "不必，你和猎人们尽快扫清威胁是最有效的办法。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂娅",
      "speakerToken": "avg_474_gladiia_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......我以为伊比利亚会更谨慎地对待她。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "圣徒卡门",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_447_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "凯尔希是一个必须谨慎对待的对象，但现在，我们有更明确的敌人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "圣徒卡门",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_447_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你打算怎么做，阿戈尔的执政官？让我们继续为阿戈尔的傲慢争执？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂娅",
      "speakerToken": "avg_474_gladiia_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "十分钟。我将解决所有的麻烦，并和我的猎人们会合。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂娅",
      "speakerToken": "avg_474_gladiia_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "之后我们再来商议如何前往那座灯塔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "圣徒卡门",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_447_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那我便留在这里，这座礼拜堂已经失去律法许久，好在有人把它擦得锃亮。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "圣徒卡门",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_447_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "它将是这场战争中唯一的光芒。伊比利亚的审判庭驻守于此，只我一人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒂亚戈",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_451_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "喂，发生什么了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "松懈的镇民",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_462_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "蒂、蒂亚戈！你上哪儿去了？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "松懈的镇民",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_462_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那些深海教徒突然出现了！还有怪物，好多怪物！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "松懈的镇民",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_462_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "啊......而且......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒂亚戈",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_451_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "而且什么？他们为什么在袭击城镇？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒂亚戈",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_451_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "阿玛雅......阿玛雅呢？这些怪物伤害你们了吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "松懈的镇民",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_462_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "他们......他们......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "松懈的镇民",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_462_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "他们没有随便伤害别人，他们只是在和......一位......审判官战斗。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒂亚戈",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_451_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "松懈的镇民",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_462_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "没有人去审判庭告密！蒂亚戈！真的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "松懈的镇民",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_462_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我们在广场上发现那只怪物的尸体没多久，审判官就出现了，现在想来，说不定就是他们干的......啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乔迪",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4042_lumen_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "怎么了？叔叔......啊，女士，下午好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乔迪",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4042_lumen_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你们脸色怎么......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒂亚戈",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_451_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "乔迪，跟我来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乔迪",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4042_lumen_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "叔叔？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒂亚戈",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_451_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "别出声。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "松懈的镇民",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_462_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "蒂、蒂亚戈，真的不是我们干的......我们跑得再快，也不可能在这么短的时间里找到审判庭呀。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒂亚戈",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_451_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......我知道。现在我们要先保护好乔迪，必须把事情解释清楚。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒂亚戈",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_451_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "可能是有人之前去的，一个星期前，一个月前，谁知道呢。邪教徒的流言蜚语已经传播这么久了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "松懈的镇民",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_462_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不、不是！起码不是我！也不是我的丈夫！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乔迪",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4042_lumen_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "难道是胡安？他们被审判庭发现了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "松懈的镇民",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_462_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......你......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "松懈的镇民",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_462_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你知道......胡安是深海教会的人？你什么时候知道的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒂亚戈",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_451_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "乔迪！走！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乔迪",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4042_lumen_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "啊......好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "松懈的镇民",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_462_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "蒂亚戈！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "松懈的镇民",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_462_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "唔......他走远了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "警惕的镇民",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_459_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "别理他，镇上情况怎么样了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "松懈的镇民",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_462_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不、不知道，那个审判官和那些外来者在和怪物们打斗，我们帮不上忙。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "警惕的镇民",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_459_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嘁......等审判官解决了这些怪物，他就会来审判我们。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "松懈的镇民",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_462_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "应、应该不会吧......等等，你在想什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "警惕的镇民",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_459_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那个审判官最好和那些怪物同归于尽......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "松懈的镇民",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_462_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你在说什么！呸呸呸！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "警惕的镇民",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_459_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你看，这么多年来，没听说几次工人们被恐鱼伤害的消息......倒是审判庭，给我们造成了多大的伤害？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "松懈的镇民",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_462_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但、但是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "警惕的镇民",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_459_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "等到审判庭反应过来，你怎么向他们证明自己不是深海教徒中的一员？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "松懈的镇民",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_462_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......那我们怎么办？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "警惕的镇民",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_459_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......如果那个审判官真能干掉这么多恐鱼......那我们......得把最可疑的人押给审判庭，才能洗清嫌疑。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "警惕的镇民",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_459_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "比如，一个与深海教会有牵连的阿戈尔人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恐鱼",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_457_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嘎......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "殿后的教徒",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_453_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......其他人，顺利撤离。但是，阿玛雅，不见踪影。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "殿后的教徒",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_453_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "除了审判官，还有深海猎人，我只从阿玛雅的只言片语里听说过她们。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "殿后的教徒",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_453_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但这里是陆地，她们没有那个审判官难缠。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "殿后的教徒",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_453_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "找出阿玛雅，带走她，然后拖住那些深海猎人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "殿后的教徒",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_453_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "走吧。其他的兄弟姐妹已经惨遭毒手，我们将是最后一批，绝不能让审判庭残害更多同胞。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恐鱼",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_457_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（附和地扭头）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒂亚戈",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_451_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "乔迪，快！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乔迪",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4042_lumen_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "好、好的......"
