    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乔迪",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4042_lumen_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒂亚戈",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_451_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "说不定来的还是个大审判官，只身一人不带队伍，就敢来寻找深海教徒的老巢，那他不会是盏省油的灯。"
