      "speakerName": "蒂亚戈",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_451_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "既然格兰法洛出现了恐鱼和那些邪教徒，那再怎么辩解也无济于事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒂亚戈",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_451_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "拿好，孩子，还有你父亲留下的灯，都拿好。"
    },
