      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乔迪",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4042_lumen_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒂亚戈",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_451_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你长大了，乔迪·方塔纳罗萨，所以我把所有事情都告诉了你，这是你拥抱新生活的最后机会。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒂亚戈",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_451_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我......这么多年我一直都想对你这么说，告诉你全部真相，尽可能劝你离开，只是我......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乔迪",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4042_lumen_1#10$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我知道，蒂亚戈叔叔......你就像是我的父亲，格兰法洛是我们的家。离开这里......我就会失去所有。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒂亚戈",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_451_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你迟早是要离开的。年轻人都想着离开，你倒是个例外。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒂亚戈",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_451_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "好了。我陪你一起走，恐鱼是种很危险的东西，但我知道怎么对付它们。只有现在，我们能从审判官的眼皮底下溜出去......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒂亚戈",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_451_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "什么声音？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乔迪",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4042_lumen_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......门那边？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒂亚戈",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_451_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "唔......嗯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒂亚戈",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_451_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......你们......你们！恐鱼不吃人！你们吃起人来倒是利落......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒂亚戈",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_451_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "说话啊！皮特！曼努埃尔！是你们在外面！海草一样的懦夫——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乔迪",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4042_lumen_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "蒂、蒂亚戈叔叔，怎么了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒂亚戈",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_451_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "他们把门堵死了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乔迪",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4042_lumen_1#11$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "什么？可是，呃，为什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒂亚戈",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_451_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "为什么？因为你是阿戈尔人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒂亚戈",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_451_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "他们肯定把这里围住了，我们上阁楼，从房顶离开。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
