      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_450_1#11$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "先给我点时间，我琢磨一下到底是自己潜回小镇找凯尔希医生，还是先找条路把你送出去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乔迪",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4042_lumen_1#13$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我陪你回去，极境先生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_450_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......确定吗？你的那个叔叔肯定想方设法才让你逃出来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乔迪",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4042_lumen_1#13$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......如果真有那么多审判庭的人手在靠近，那我也逃不出来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_450_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你的使命值得你献出生命吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乔迪",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4042_lumen_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "欸？什、什么......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_450_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你甚至都没有一个清晰的目的，只是怀着对使命的憧憬就要回到格兰法洛？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_450_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "别开玩笑了兄弟，我建议......你离开这里，带着其他不想被卷进来的镇民，越快越好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_450_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我们不是在森林里露营，然后遇到了一群源石虫的袭击——我不想这么说，但我觉得普通人帮不上忙。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乔迪",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4042_lumen_1#11$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我只是隐隐觉得......或者我......也许还有什么使命没有完成。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乔迪",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4042_lumen_1#11$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我从小在这里长大，听着那些传说，看着海岸线，阅读着父母留下的笔记。我不想以这种形式告别这里......我......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乔迪",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4042_lumen_1#10$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我只是把这里当做自己的故乡啊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
